        "0009a9e0",
        "0009a9e4",
        "0009a9ec",
        "0009a9f0"
      ],
      "fact": "Incoming x3 is saved/retained as x20; incoming receiver x0 is saved as x21; key x2 is retained as x19. The Ghidra C signature omits x3, so assembly and ObjC metadata control ABI interpretation.",
      "fact_ja": "入口のx3は保持・retainされ、receiverはx21、keyはx19へ保存される。Cの引数表示だけではABIを復元できない。"
    },
    {
      "id": "H013-02",
      "anchors": [
        "0009a9f8",
        "0009aa04",
        "0009aa08",
        "0009aa0c",
        "0009aa18",
        "0009aa1c"
      ],
      "fact": "Key isEqualToString:keyboardIndex tests bit0 of w0; set bit enters integer path. Otherwise isEqualToString:outputChannel tests w0 nonzero; nonzero enters the same integer path.",
      "fact_ja": "keyboardIndex比較はw0のbit0、outputChannel比較はw0全体の非0を使い、整数枝を選ぶ。"
    },
    {
      "id": "H013-03",
      "anchors": [
        "0009aa20",
        "0009aa24",
        "0009aa28",
        "0009aa2c",
        "0009aa30"
      ],
      "fact": "Integer path sends decodeIntegerForKey: to incoming receiver x21 using key x19, saves signed64 result x0 in x22 and joins common return cleanup.",
      "fact_ja": "整数枝は保存receiverへkeyを渡してdecodeIntegerForKey:を送り、返値ワードを保存する。"
    },
    {
      "id": "H013-04",
      "anchors": [
        "0009aa34",
        "0009aa38",
        "0009aa3c",
        "0009aa40",
        "0009aa44",
        "0009aa48",
        "0009aa4c"
      ],
      "fact": "Other-key path loads imported NSNumber, calls objc_opt_class, passes its returned class x0 as x2 to decodeObjectOfClass:forKey: on receiver x21 with key x19 in x3.",
      "fact_ja": "その他のキーはNSNumberに対するobjc_opt_classの返値をclass引数へ渡し、保存receiverへobject decoderを送る。"
    },
    {
      "id": "H013-05",
      "anchors": [
        "0009aa54",
        "0009aa58",
        "0009aa5c",
        "0009aa60",
        "0009aa64",
        "0009aa68"
      ],
      "fact": "Object result is retained using objc_retainAutoreleasedReturnValue, sent longValue without a caller-side nil/type/result branch, x0 saved to x22, object then released. Native coder semantics and runtime selector dispatch remain unexamined.",
      "fact_ja": "objectをretainし、追加のnil・型・error判定なしでlongValueを送り、返値を保存してobjectをreleaseする。"
    },
    {
      "id": "H013-06",
      "anchors": [
        "0009aa6c",
        "0009aa70",
        "0009aa74",
        "0009aa78",
        "0009aa7c",
        "0009aa90"
      ],
      "fact": "Normal cleanup releases retained incoming x3 and key, returns saved result x22 in x0. Incoming x3 has no use other than retain/release in the complete saved 208 B body. It is not the object-path key x3, which is overwritten from x19.",
      "fact_ja": "通常終了で追加のincoming x3とkeyをreleaseし、保存した64 bitワードを返す。incoming x3は本文でretain/release以外に使わない。"
    },
    {
      "id": "H013-07",
      "anchors": [
        "0009bf88",
        "0009bf8c",
        "0009bf90",
        "0009bf94"
      ],
      "fact": "Setter reads signed runtime ivar offset slot001ab508 and directly stores low byte of w2. No mask/normalization/extra call in this 16 B body.",
      "fact_ja": "setterはruntime offset slotを読み、w2の下位byteを直接格納する。mask・正規化・別callなし。"
    },
    {
      "id": "H013-08",
      "anchors": [
        "0009bd60",
        "0009bd64",
        "0009bd68",
        "0009bd6c"
      ],
      "fact": "Long getter reads signed runtime offset slot001ab4dc and loads the 64-bit field into x0; no conversion/store/call in this 16 B body.",
      "fact_ja": "旧long getterはruntime offset slotを読み、64 bit fieldを直接返す。変換・格納・別callなし。"
    },
    {
      "id": "H013-09",
      "anchors": [
        "0009bd70",
        "0009bd74",
        "0009bd78",
        "0009bd7c",
        "0009bd80"
      ],
      "fact": "Flag getter reads signed runtime offset slot001ab4d8, loads one byte, masks bit0 into w0 and returns; no field update in this 20 B body.",
      "fact_ja": "旧形式flag getterはbyteを読み、bit0だけ返す。fieldの更新なし。"
    },
    {
      "id": "H013-10",
      "anchors": [
        "0009a9c4",
        "0009aa90"
      ],
      "fact": "Complete saved helper body has no containsValueForKey: send, native error argument/inspection, retry or scalar long-to-double conversion. Missing key/wrong type/nil/unarchiver failure and exception-unwind behavior are not established by these normal-path instructions.",
      "fact_ja": "helper本文にcontains判定・native error検査・retry・longからdoubleへの変換はない。native失敗・例外動作は未確認。"
    }
